  "subtitle": "The bass machine that failed so badly its programming became a genre",
  "why_scout_cares": "A display-less two-pass step sequencer whose inscrutable programming ritual created acid house. The purest case in the collection of an illegible interface becoming a creative affordance — and the perfect dark twin to the legible LED grid of the TR-808.",
